---
import { cfImageUrl, CF_IMAGES } from '../config/site';
---

<section id="why" class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-20 border-b border-line">
  <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
    <div class="reveal">
      <p class="modern-pill mb-4">WHY THIS DOMAIN</p>
      <h2 class="font-display text-3xl sm:text-4xl tracking-tight mb-6">
        A name that commands premium pricing from day one
      </h2>
      <p class="text-muted leading-relaxed mb-6">
        VanityWax.com is more than a domain — it's instant brand authority in the $12B+
        hair removal and body waxing industry. In a market where trust and luxury perception drive revenue,
        this name positions your business at the top from the very first visit.
      </p>
      <ul class="space-y-3 text-ink">
        <li class="flex items-start gap-x-3">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-accent mt-0.5 shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" />
          </svg>
          <span>Instantly communicates premium-tier hair removal and waxing services</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-x-3">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-accent mt-0.5 shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" />
          </svg>
          <span>Memorable, brandable, and linguistically authoritative</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-x-3">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-accent mt-0.5 shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" />
          </svg>
          <span>Exact-match keyword domain for high-intent beauty search traffic</span>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="relative reveal" style="--reveal-delay: 120ms">
      <div class="rounded-3xl overflow-hidden border border-line">
        <img
          src={cfImageUrl(CF_IMAGES.heroImageId)}
          alt="VanityWax.com — Premium Body Waxing Domain"
          class="w-full h-auto"
          width="600"
          height="400"
          loading="lazy"
          decoding="async"
        />
      </div>
      <div class="absolute -bottom-4 -right-4 w-48 h-48 rounded-full bg-accent/10 blur-3xl pointer-events-none" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
